{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Greeblings, chaos unfolds as players take on wildly different roles in a colorful world of traps, items, and precision shots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811700/extras/07ffbb0b57cccbb7e489d24e330c10b5.poster.avif?t=1764606385\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811700/extras/07ffbb0b57cccbb7e489d24e330c10b5.webm?t=1764606385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811700/extras/07ffbb0b57cccbb7e489d24e330c10b5.mp4?t=1764606385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Greeblings can obtain items such as fishing rods and fire extingushers to aid them in there mission to escape the hunters, The hunters can use an aresnal of traps and abilites like drones and missiles to stop the greeblings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every round is quick, chaotic, and full of surprises. Greeblings turns simple platforming into a vibrant, asymmetric showdown packed with laughs and unpredictable twists.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3811700?t=1764606385","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811700/bc30d7ad950028a686022369afb31025fd28de5a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764606385","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811700/34d3635acf90cb42ee6b626da01222f87a905698/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764606385","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811700/34d3635acf90cb42ee6b626da01222f87a905698/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764606385","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","i